    "detailed_description": "<strong><u>AfroCobra </u></strong>is a side scrolling action love letter to Kung Fu Master / Spartan X.  With 16-bit stylized pixel graphics for a throwback to the roots of action platforming.  A fast-paced beat em up style game, with non-stop action and enemy assaults.  Duck, jump, kick, and use the power of Dragonflys to stay alive and on the move.<br><br><strong><u>Fast-Paced Beat Em Up Arcade Style Action:</u></strong> With a constant flow of enemies and stage hazards, keeping your reflexes sharp and quickly strategizing is your only chance for survival.  Enemy movement and logic cover a wide range and must be quickly identified to overcome their threat.<br><br><strong><u>Unique Atmosphere and Progression:</u></strong> Level designs and unique level music ques invite you to experience different feelings and environments as each is designed to reward players with a sense of progression as the game unfolds.  Slowly feel time turn from day to night, before taking on the ultimate final boss.<br><br><strong><u>Familiar But New Feel:</u></strong> Gameplay style that will feel recognizable to any action platform gamer, while introducing a flow of level design not seen in earlier action platformers that inspired it.",
